

# One line per change people will notice. Each line becomes one entry
# in the release notes, so write it for users, not for the code:
#
#   feat(agent): web_search tool to find real pages
#
#   fix(tui): no flicker when resizing the terminal
#
# Several changes in one commit: one line each, blank lines between.
# Types: feat, fix, perf, docs (shown); refactor, test, build, ci
# (under the hood); chore (hidden). Details: .github/release-notes/README.md
